> import: typesafe:
  BooleanCriteria
  ChoiceCriteria

```
from typing import Annotated, Literal
from kedi import decision_info

Team = Annotated[
    Literal["billing", "access", "general"],
    "Which team owns the customer's primary request?",
    ChoiceCriteria({
        "billing": "Charges, payments, or invoices",
        "access": "Signing in or account access",
        "general": "Other requests",
    }),
]
Urgent = Annotated[
    bool,
    "Does the request need immediate intervention?",
    BooleanCriteria(
        true="Active loss of access or ongoing financial harm",
        false="Past resolved problem, general question, or hypothetical concern",
    ),
]
```

> model: typesafe/jev-latest
> settings:
  typesafe_threshold: 0.85

@route_ticket(ticket: str) -> str:
  >> The support team responsible for <ticket> is [team: Team].
  Whether the request needs immediate intervention is [urgent: Urgent].

  > show: Immediate intervention required: <urgent>
  > show: Urgency probability: <`decision_info("urgent").probability`>
  > show: Decision threshold: <`decision_info("urgent").threshold`>

  > if: `urgent`:
    = Escalate to <team>.
  > else:
    = Queue for <team>.

= <route_ticket(My card is still being charged every hour for the same invoice. Please stop these duplicate payments.)>
